checksum deltas\nare not supported. Check <a href=\"rsync-compat.html\">rsync compatibility</a> before\nsubstituting it in an existing script.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Syq supports common rsync options, but uses its own protocol.","zh":null},{"en":"Rsync filter rules, hard links, ACLs, xattrs, sparse files, and rolling-checksum deltas are not supported.","zh":null},{"en":"Check rsync compatibility before substituting it in an existing script.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"common-tasks\"><a href=\"#common-tasks\">Common tasks</a></h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Common tasks","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<th>I want to…</th>","sentences":[{"en":"I want to…","zh":"我想要…"}]},{"html_en":"<th>Start here</th>","sentences":[{"en":"Start here","zh":"从这里开始"}]},{"html_en":"<td>Choose exactly where files land</td>","sentences":[{"en":"Choose exactly where files land","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"reference.html\">Copy and placement</a></td>","sentences":[{"en":"Copy and placement","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td>Preview changes</td>","sentences":[{"en":"Preview changes","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"reference.html#preview-changes\">Dry runs</a></td>","sentences":[{"en":"Dry runs","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td>Skip build files or use <code>.gitignore</code></td>","sentences":[{"en":"Skip build files or use .gitignore","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"reference.html#ignoring-paths\">Ignoring paths</a></td>","sentences":[{"en":"Ignoring paths","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td>Mirror a directory</td>","sentences":[{"en":"Mirror a directory","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"reference.html#mirror-a-directory\">Mirroring</a></td>","sentences":[{"en":"Mirroring","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td>Remove files in parallel</td>","sentences":[{"en":"Remove files in parallel","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"remove.html\">Removal</a></td>","sentences":[{"en":"Removal","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td>Send files to my laptop from a server’s shell</td>","sentences":[{"en":"Send files to my laptop from a server’s shell","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"receive.html\">Receiving files</a></td>","sentences":[{"en":"Receiving files","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td>Run a build or open an artifact on my desktop from a server</td>","sentences":[{"en":"Run a build or open an artifact on my desktop from a server","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"exec.html\">Commands on your receiving machine</a></td>","sentences":[{"en":"Commands on your receiving machine","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td>Copy between two servers</td>","sentences":[{"en":"Copy between two servers","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"remote-to-remote.html\">Remote-to-remote transfers</a></td>","sentences":[{"en":"Remote-to-remote transfers","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td>Rename or reorganize files during a copy</td>","sentences":[{"en":"Rename or reorganize files during a copy","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"mappings.html\">Mappings</a></td>","sentences":[{"en":"Mappings","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td>Use syq from Python</td>","sentences":[{"en":"Use syq from Python","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"python.html\">Python SDK</a></td>","sentences":[{"en":"Python SDK","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td>Read results from a script</td>","sentences":[{"en":"Read results from a script","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"automation.html\">Automation results</a></td>","sentences":[{"en":"Automation results","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td>Make copies faster</td>","sentences":[{"en":"Make copies faster","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"speed.html\">Speed</a></td>","sentences":[]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\">\n    <div id=\"mdbook-help-container\">\n            <h2>键盘快捷键</h2>\n            <div>\n                <p>按 ← 或 → 在章节之间导航</p>\n                <p>按 S 或 / 在书中搜索</p>\n                <p>按 ？ 显示此帮助</p>\n                <p>按 Esc 键隐藏此帮助</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    <div id=\"mdbook-body-container\">\n        <!-- Work around some values being stored in localStorage wrapped in quotes -->\n        \n\n        <!-- Set the theme before any content is loaded, prevents flash -->\n        \n\n        \n\n        <!-- Hide / unhide sidebar before it is displayed -->\n        \n\n        <nav id=\"mdbook-sidebar\" aria-label=\"Table of contents\">\n            <!-- populated by js -->\n            <mdbook-sidebar-scrollbox></mdbook-sidebar-scrollbox>\n            \n            \n        </nav>\n\n        <div id=\"mdbook-page-wrapper\">\n\n            <div class=\"page\">\n                <header>\n                  <a href=\"https://greaber.github.io/syq/\" aria-label=\"syq home\">syq</a>\n                  <nav aria-label=\"syq sites\">\n                    <a href=\"https://greaber.github.io/syq/\" data-site=\"docs\">Documentation</a>\n                    <a href=\"https://greaber.github.io/syq-bench/\" data-site=\"benchmarks\">Benchmarks</a>\n                    <a href=\"https://github.com/greaber/syq\">GitHub ↗</a>\n                  </nav>\n                </header>\n                \n                \n\n                \n\n                <!-- Apply ARIA attributes after the sidebar and the sidebar toggle button are added to the DOM -->\n                \n\n                <div id=\"mdbook-content\">\n                    <main>\n                        <h2 aria-label=\"syq: Fast, programmable file operations\" id=\"copy-files-with-syq\">syq Fast, programmable file operations.</h2>\n\n<p>Copy, reorganize and remove files—locally or across machines. Resume interrupted transfers, send files to your laptop or run commands there from a server’s remote shell, and script syq using the JSON API or Python SDK. Your laptop needs no SSH server or incoming network port.</p>\n<nav aria-label=\"Explore syq\">\n<a href=\"install.html\">Install syq</a>\n<a href=\"https://greaber.github.io/syq-bench/\">Benchmarks ↗</a>\n<a href=\"receive.html\">Send files to your laptop</a>\n<a href=\"exec.html\">Run commands on your laptop</a>\n<a href=\"remote-to-remote.html\">Copy directly between servers without forwarding your SSH agent</a>\n<a href=\"mappings.html\">Rename and reorganize files during a copy</a>\n<a href=\"automation.html\">JSON API</a>\n<a href=\"python.html\">Python SDK</a>\n</nav>\n<h2 id=\"try-a-copy\">Try a copy</h2>\n<p>Replace server with an SSH hostname or alias you normally connect to, and project with a local directory:</p>\n<pre><code>syq cp project --to server --into backup\n</code></pre>\n<p>This creates or updates backup/project in your home directory on the server. To copy the contents of project directly into backup, use --srcs-in:</p>\n<pre><code>syq cp --srcs-in project --to server --into backup\n</code></pre>\n<p>Use --dry-run to preview a summary without copying, or --dry-run -v to list the planned changes by path. Existing destination files are updated when needed. Unrelated files stay unless you request --prune.</p>\n<h2 id=\"already-use-rsync\">Already use rsync?</h2>\n<p>Start with your usual command, prefixed by syq:</p>\n<pre><code>syq rsync -av project/ server:backup/project/\nsyq rsync -av server:data/ ./data/\n</code></pre>\n<p>Syq supports common rsync options, but uses its own protocol. Rsync filter rules, hard links, ACLs, xattrs, sparse files, and rolling-checksum deltas are not supported. Check rsync compatibility before substituting it in an existing script.</p>\n<h2 id=\"common-tasks\">Common tasks</h2>\n<div>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr><th>我想要…</th><th>从这里开始</th></tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Choose exactly where files land</td><td>Copy and placement</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Preview changes</td><td>Dry runs</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Skip build files or use .gitignore</td><td>Ignoring paths</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Mirror a directory</td><td>Mirroring</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Remove files in parallel</td><td>Removal</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Send files to my laptop from a server’s shell</td><td>Receiving files</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Run a build or open an artifact on my desktop from a server</td><td>Commands on your receiving machine</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Copy between two servers</td><td>Remote-to-remote transfers</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Rename or reorganize files during a copy</td><td>Mappings</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Use syq from Python</td><td>Python SDK</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Read results from a script</td><td>Automation results</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Make copies faster</td><td><a href=\"speed.html\">Speed</a></td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n                    </main>\n\n                    <nav aria-label=\"Page navigation\">\n                        <!-- Mobile navigation buttons -->\n\n                            <a rel=\"next prefetch\" href=\"install.html\" title=\"Next chapter\" aria-label=\"Next chapter\" aria-keyshortcuts=\"Right\">\n                                <span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"><!--! Font Awesome Free 6.2.0 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) Copyright 2022 Fonticons, Inc. --><path d=\"M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z\" /></svg></span>\n                            </a>\n\n                        \n                    </nav>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <nav aria-label=\"Page navigation\">\n\n                    <a rel=\"next prefetch\" href=\"install.html\" title=\"Next chapter\" aria-label=\"Next chapter\" aria-keyshortcuts=\"Right\">\n                        <span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"><!--! Font Awesome Free 6.2.0 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) Copyright 2022 Fonticons, Inc. --><path d=\"M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 